EMC_TOOL_UPDATE and EMC_TOOL_DELETE have no Python binding, so tool-cmd.cc sends
them over NML the way the native server does and reports the result from the
echoed serial number and the RCS status.

A refused update or delete fails that command with an operator error. The
machine keeps its state: no abort, spindle and coolant stay on, an open program
stays open, and the next command succeeds.
